}

Then you can use the Data Structures documentation to make an unordered_map of your products. If you want to make sure that the products are unique by id, you can use this code:
var productMap: unordered_map<String, Product> = defaultMap<String: Product>(HashSet(distinct { $0.id }))

Now you might notice a problem. You have multiple products with the same name, but the description is different. How can you make sure that the descriptions are different?
The easiest way to do that is to use an array:
let descriptions = [String]()

